WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:07.212
[Ammamma hums] Vaavo… vaavo… Mole, kettoo… (My girl, you hear me?)

2
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.728
You remember the smell of coconut oil and rain.

3
00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:13.151
Achan's scooter.

4
00:00:13.201 --> 00:00:15.456
Her hand on your head.

5
00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:22.608
Then the train. Then the airport. Then a life, very far away.

6
00:00:23.017 --> 00:00:28.139
You called her on Sundays. You always meant to record one.

7
00:00:30.017 --> 00:00:33.533
Now you try to hear her voice… and it's going quiet.

8
00:00:36.017 --> 00:00:39.064
Kin is a place your family keeps each other.

9
00:00:39.114 --> 00:00:42.792
Even an elder with a simple phone can just talk.

10
00:00:44.017 --> 00:00:49.117
Their voices, photos and stories grow on one living family tree.

11
00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:51.721
Every person has a lifetime.

12
00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:57.032
Nothing is shared without their yes. It stays in the family.

13
00:00:58.383 --> 00:01:04.395
[Ammamma hums] Vaavo… vaavo… Mole, kettoo… (My girl, you hear me?)

14
00:01:07.308 --> 00:01:10.055
And somehow… it's still hers to give.

15
00:01:14.308 --> 00:01:17.421
Kin. Keep their voices close.

